         <title>NarrowbandProcessing 1.1</title>
         <description>
            <p>Sharper preview at your screen's full resolution, Zoom Fit / 100% (double-click, drag to pan), Quality Sharp / Balanced / Fast, and American spelling (color, center, gray).</p>
            <p>After installing, restart PixInsight and open Script &gt; Utilities &gt; NarrowbandProcessing.</p>
